WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:18.951
"Just in time, Grandpa said to Luke and Katie.

2
00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.532
"There are two slices of apple pie left."

3
00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:23.753
"My favorite!"

4
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.093
exclaimed Luke.

5
00:00:25.674 --> 00:00:28.555
He and Katie joined the family around the kitchen table.

6
00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:32.457
"So you caught some worms," said Dad.

7
00:00:32.477 --> 00:00:35.919
"You should have seen me," bragged Katie.

8
00:00:36.439 --> 00:00:38.901
She grabbed an imaginary worm from the air.

9
00:00:38.921 --> 00:00:39.942
"Got it!"

10
00:00:40.462 --> 00:00:41.142
she shouted.

11
00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:43.484
"Stop right there!"

12
00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.685
said Mom.

13
00:00:45.305 --> 00:00:49.228
She was looking at Katie's hand—her very dirty hand.

14
00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:52.710
"Yuck," said Joy.

15
00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:55.572
"Uh-oh," said Katie.

16
00:00:56.132 --> 00:00:57.033
She looked at Luke.

17
00:00:58.114 --> 00:00:59.635
Luke looked at his own hands.

18
00:00:59.655 --> 00:01:02.385
"Gross," he said.

19
00:01:02.405 --> 00:01:06.488
"Come on," grumbled Katie, standing up.

20
00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:10.231
"Let's go wash up and put these dirty rags in the hamper."

21
00:01:11.532 --> 00:01:13.794
Katie and Luke climbed back up the stairs.

22
00:01:13.814 --> 00:01:15.615
"Don't eat our pie!"

23
00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:17.517
Katie called down the steps.

24
00:01:18.758 --> 00:01:23.962
"Mealtime is no time for worm slime," Luke said with a chuckle.

25
00:01:23.982 --> 00:01:30.888
"Hey, you just made a rhyme about slime," said Katie, giggling.

26
00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:32.948
"So did you!"

27
00:01:33.449 --> 00:01:34.369
exclaimed Luke.

28
00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.931
Katie led the way down the hall, past the spare room.

29
00:01:38.951 --> 00:01:44.673
"Listen to those chicks," said Luke.

30
00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:46.534
"They are loud!"

31
00:01:46.554 --> 00:01:48.595
"They sure are!"

32
00:01:48.995 --> 00:01:49.936
complained Katie.

33
00:01:50.436 --> 00:01:51.736
Then she stopped, worried.

34
00:01:51.756 --> 00:01:53.037
"Wait a minute.

35
00:01:53.457 --> 00:01:54.518
Is that door open?"

36
00:01:56.038 --> 00:01:57.979
She looked back toward the spare room.

37
00:01:57.999 --> 00:01:59.800
"It should be closed!"

38
00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:03.253
Katie and Luke hurried into the spare room.

39
00:02:03.694 --> 00:02:05.135
Katie switched on the light.

40
00:02:05.155 --> 00:02:08.517
"JELLYBEAN!" she cried.

41
00:02:09.077 --> 00:02:10.758
The cat's head was in the box.

42
00:02:11.979 --> 00:02:13.599
Everything happened so fast.

43
00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.962
Jellybean leaped up and landed on the desk.

44
00:02:19.383 --> 00:02:23.125
Luke tried to grab Jellybean, but the cat leaped to the floor.

45
00:02:24.246 --> 00:02:27.748
Then Jellybean ran out the door and down the hall.

46
00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.062
A white ball of fluff was in her mouth.

47
00:02:31.082 --> 00:02:33.424
"COME BACK HERE!"

48
00:02:33.984 --> 00:02:34.865
screamed Katie.

49
00:02:34.885 --> 00:02:36.746
"Mom! Dad!

50
00:02:37.226 --> 00:02:42.730
Help!" Katie and Luke chased Jellybean into Mom and Dad's bedroom.

51
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.932
"Where is she?"

52
00:02:45.492 --> 00:02:46.213
cried Katie.

53
00:02:46.753 --> 00:02:49.175
She dropped to the floor and looked under the bed.

54
00:02:50.275 --> 00:02:53.838
Katie could see Jellybean's yellow eyes shining in the dark.

55
00:02:54.478 --> 00:02:56.600
A white chick was in the cat's mouth.

56
00:02:57.628 --> 00:02:59.689
The frightened chick cheeped loudly.

57
00:03:01.869 --> 00:03:04.070
Katie pulled her head out from under the bed.

58
00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.851
The whole family was looking down at her with wide eyes.

59
00:03:07.871 --> 00:03:12.512
"Jellybean has a chick," she said grimly.

60
00:03:13.672 --> 00:03:14.553
Joy gasped.

61
00:03:14.573 --> 00:03:18.294
"Uh-oh," said Dad.

62
00:03:18.314 --> 00:03:21.475
"Not good," added Grandpa.

63
00:03:25.096 --> 00:03:26.496
worry," said Katie.

64
00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.520
"I think I can get it back."

65
00:03:29.681 --> 00:03:32.962
Then she wiggled under the bed, trying not to panic.

66
00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:38.483
"Hello, Jellybean," she said softly, facing the cat.

67
00:03:38.503 --> 00:03:40.104
"What have you got?"

68
00:03:41.204 --> 00:03:45.025
Looking like a proud hunter, Jellybean held on to the chick.

69
00:03:45.045 --> 00:03:48.746
"Come on, Jellybean," Katie whispered.

70
00:03:48.766 --> 00:03:51.047
"Let me have the baby chick."

71
00:03:52.587 --> 00:03:54.448
Katie slowly reached out.

72
00:03:55.016 --> 00:03:57.857
She gently cupped her hands underneath the chick.

73
00:04:03.039 --> 00:04:07.081
Jellybean opened her mouth, and the chick fell into Katie's hands.

74
00:04:07.101 --> 00:04:11.143
"Thank you, Jellybean," whispered Katie.

75
00:04:11.723 --> 00:04:13.784
Then she wiggled out from under the bed.

76
00:04:13.804 --> 00:04:16.485
"Got it!"

77
00:04:16.945 --> 00:04:18.405
Katie said as she stood up.

78
00:04:18.425 --> 00:04:20.586
"Thank you, Katie!"

79
00:04:21.146 --> 00:04:22.107
exclaimed Joy.

80
00:04:22.127 --> 00:04:25.744
"Let's check on the others," said Mom.

81
00:04:26.925 --> 00:04:28.485
Everyone rushed to the box.

82
00:04:28.505 --> 00:04:35.928
"One, two, three, four, five," counted Katie.

83
00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.930
She put the white chick back with the others.

84
00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.571
"Six," she said.

85
00:04:42.871 --> 00:04:44.552
Luke was standing in the doorway.

86
00:04:45.152 --> 00:04:46.313
He looked unhappy.

87
00:04:46.333 --> 00:04:50.034
"This was my fault," he said.

88
00:04:50.054 --> 00:04:52.215
"I left the door open."

89
00:04:52.235 --> 00:04:55.829
"No," replied Katie.

90
00:04:55.849 --> 00:04:57.710
"It was my fault."

91
00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.371
She looked at Joy.

92
00:04:59.391 --> 00:05:02.593
"I forgot to make sure the door was closed.

93
00:05:03.173 --> 00:05:04.554
I'm sorry, Joy."

94
00:05:05.975 --> 00:05:07.435
Joy gave Katie a hug.

95
00:05:07.455 --> 00:05:10.977
"We still have six chicks," she said.

96
00:05:10.998 --> 00:05:13.159
"So everything is okay."

97
00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.640
Katie nodded.

98
00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.682
"That was close," she murmured.

99
00:05:18.702 --> 00:05:24.953
"Well," Grandpa spoke up, "I still have two slices of pie downstairs.

100
00:05:25.593 --> 00:05:26.453
Anybody interested?"

101
00:05:26.473 --> 00:05:29.934
"Absolutely!" said Katie.

102
00:05:29.954 --> 00:05:32.095
"Let's go!"

103
00:05:32.615 --> 00:05:33.496
exclaimed Luke.

104
00:05:34.736 --> 00:05:35.556
"Wait a minute!"

105
00:05:36.076 --> 00:05:36.837
warned Mom.

106
00:05:36.857 --> 00:05:38.797
"Forgetting something?"

107
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:41.658
Katie and Luke looked at each other.

108
00:05:42.238 --> 00:05:44.099
They both held up their hands.

109
00:05:44.119 --> 00:05:46.159
"Worm slime!"

110
00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.400
they cried.
